        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the failure of tests due to the absence of the native library required for `NativeMap`, which was mandated by changes made in `NativeMap.java` as part of ACCUMULO-4596. The tests were incorrectly configured to enable native maps without ensuring that the native library was available, leading to test failures when trying to use existing instances with the native map feature enabled.

        Commit message:
        ACCUMULO-4674 Fixed ExistingMacIT  

        Patch:

   @Override
   public void configure(MiniAccumuloConfigImpl cfg, Configuration hadoopCoreSite) {
     cfg.setProperty(Property.INSTANCE_ZK_TIMEOUT, "15s");
+    // NativeMap.java was changed to fail if native lib missing in ACCUMULO-4596
+    // testExistingInstance will fail because the native path is not set in MiniAccumuloConfigImpl.useExistingInstance
+    // so disable Native maps for this test
+    cfg.setProperty(Property.TSERV_NATIVEMAP_ENABLED, "false");

     // use raw local file system so walogs sync and flush will work
     hadoopCoreSite.set("fs.file.impl", RawLocalFileSystem.class.getName());
   }



